OL,3,GNEWSAReverend prays fire-hit church
OL,4,Awill reopen in 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe reverend of a church that was
OL,7,Fgutted by fire a year ago is praying it
OL,8,Fwill reopen in time for Christmas 2027.
OL,10,FSt John's Baptist Church in Harleston,
OL,11,FNorfolk, was engulfed in flames on 1
OL,12,FOctober and while fire crews managed to
OL,13,Fsave a lot of the structure, there was
OL,14,Fsignificant internal damage.
OL,16,FNorfolk Fire and Rescue Service said
OL,17,Fthe cause of the blaze, which started
OL,18,Fin the kitchen of the Grade II listed
OL,19,Fbuilding, was ruled as accidental.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
