OL,3,GNEWSAReverend prays fire-hit church
OL,4,Awill reopen in 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FReverend Jonathan Richardson said he
OL,7,Fcould not give an exact reopening date,
OL,8,Fbut prayed it would be possible to
OL,9,F"actually do a carol service" from the
OL,10,Fchurch next year.
